#. type: paragraph
#: configuration.org:183
msgid ""
"Provides stable packages when unstable has build failures or "
"regressions. Mainly used by the =stable= overlay (see "
"[[file:overlays/configuration.org][overlays/configuration.org]]) for "
"packages that are broken in unstable."
