msgstr ""

#. type: paragraph
#: modules/configuration.org:2045
msgid ""
"I read GitHub issues and notifications in Emacs through "
"[[https://github.com/magit/forge][forge]], whose API layer =ghub= takes the "
"account name from =github.user= to find the matching =~/.authinfo.age= "
"entry. Without it a pull aborts with \"Cannot determine username\" before "
"any request goes out, and the notification list keeps showing whatever the "
"last successful fetch stored. The token that goes with it is described in "
"the forge section below."
msgstr ""

