"=core.editor = \"vim\"= is set as the fallback editor for git "
"operations. Although the =EDITOR= environment variable is set to =nvim= in "
"the home configuration, some contexts (like =git commit= in a minimal "
"environment) may not inherit the session's environment variables. Setting it "
"explicitly in gitconfig ensures consistent behavior."
