"Declares a Forgejo Actions runner hosted on a Windows guest, reusing the "
"golden image from [[*Windows][the Windows VM module]]."
msgstr ""

#. type: paragraph
#: modules/configuration.org:4371
msgid ""
"The guest boots from an ephemeral overlay recreated on each VM start via a "
"libvirt hook. A persistent secondary disk (D:) preserves the runner "
"credentials, toolchains, and cargo caches across resets."
msgstr ""

#. type: paragraph in src
#: modules/configuration.org:4381
#, no-wrap
