#. type: heading ***
#: modules/configuration.org:5614
#, no-wrap
msgid "Daemon PATH"
msgstr ""

#. type: paragraph
#: modules/configuration.org:5616
msgid ""
"launchd hands its agents only the system =PATH=, and =init.org= repairs "
"=PATH= with =exec-path-from-shell= only when =window-system= is non-nil, "
"which a daemon start never satisfies. So the daemon came up with no Nix "
"profile in sight, died during package initialization, and =KeepAlive= "
"restarted it every ten seconds — each start reaching =/usr/bin/gcc= for "
"native compilation, which on a machine without Xcode is the stub that opens "
"the Command Line Tools installer. I hand the agent a =PATH= of its own."
msgstr ""

#. type: keyword NAME
#: modules/configuration.org:5625
#, no-wrap
msgid "emacs-daemon-path"
msgstr ""

#. type: paragraph in src
#: modules/configuration.org:5627
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"launchd.agents = lib.optionalAttrs pkgs.stdenv.hostPlatform.isDarwin {\n"
"  emacs.config.EnvironmentVariables.PATH = lib.concatStringsSep \":\" [\n"
"    \"${config.home.profileDirectory}/bin\"\n"
"    \"/run/current-system/sw/bin\"\n"
"    \"/nix/var/nix/profiles/default/bin\"\n"
"    \"/usr/bin\"\n"
"    \"/bin\"\n"
"    \"/usr/sbin\"\n"
"    \"/sbin\"\n"
"  ];\n"
"};"
msgstr ""

